00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:24.580
Giga Berlin. Buyers can combine the offer with government subsidies up to 6,000 euros.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:30.600
Orders and deliveries must occur before September 30. The financing targets end of quarter

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:36.780
volume at the German plant. Tesla plans to build a 16-bay supercharger location accessible

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:41.780
to any electric vehicle. The site expands the network's open access footprint.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:46.720
Construction plans cover a single large installation designed for mixed fleets.

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:51.600
The location adds capacity in an area previously served by smaller stations.

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:56.820
The project follows earlier moves to open existing stations to non-tesla drivers.

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:01.800
Site selection focuses on corridors where demand for multiple brands has grown.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:04.880
known. No timeline for opening has been released yet.

